{'symbol': 'ESS', 'date': '2022-10-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'ESSEX ANNOUNCES THE PLANNED RETIREMENT OF MICHAEL J. SCHALL AS PRESIDENT & CEO AND APPOINTMENT OF ANGELA L.', 'text': "SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ESSEX PROPERTY TRUST, INC. (NYSE:ESS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PLANNED RETIREMENT OF MICHAEL J. SCHALL, THE COMPANY'S PRESIDENT AND CEO SINCE 2011, EFFECTIVE MARCH 31, 2023. THEREAFTER, MR. SCHALL WILL CONTINUE TO SERVE ON THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND WILL REMAIN ON AS A PART-TIME EMPLOYEE. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPOINTED ANGELA L. KLEIMAN, THE COMPANY'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, TO SUCCEED MR. SCHALL AS PRESIDENT AN"}